      "title": "install= cannot be statically resolved",
      "description": "The install scriptlet name is not a plain value the scanner can resolve (eval of an expansion, or source of another file). makepkg runs whichever file it names as the package's install scriptlet, so every file beside the PKGBUILD was scanned as a possible scriptlet.",
